<title>INDIA: India TELCO 97/98 Q1 equipment sales up.</title>
<headline>India TELCO 97/98 Q1 equipment sales up.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The construction equipment business of truck and utility machinery maker Tata Engineering and Locomotive Company Ltd (TELCO) rose 35 percent in the first quarter of 1997/98 (April-March), its chairman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Chairman Ratan Tata was addressing shareholders at the firm's annual general meeting. He did not give details.</p>
<p>TELCO's total turnover in the first quarter was down 10 percent over the same period a year ago, he said.</p>
<p>--Bombay newsroom +91-22-265-9000</p>
</text>
